WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:10.630
You are not one of us,
and yet he treats you as so.

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:14.300
Servants will always be servants.
That is our way.

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:15.260
The old way.

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:21.230
Perhaps the old way
should be left in the past.

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:28.150
I have been searching for you.

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:29.400
I'm just a boatsman.

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:31.190
Nothing special about me.

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:34.450
This world is full of evil.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:39.870
There is a prophecy…

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.620
that a Black warrior
will one day come…

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:46.540
to save the people.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.050
I found him.

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:56.050
A true warrior,
above all else, prays for peace.

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:02.060
But today we fight
for the future of Japan.

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.610
The one we've waited for.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.190
The one who can deliver us victory.

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:16.110
Yasuke,
the legendary Black samurai.

